## Frontend environment variables (Create React App)
##
## Copy to `.env` to apply locally:
##   cp .env.example .env
##
## Base URL of backend API (must include protocol).
## Example:
##   REACT_APP_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8080/
##   REACT_APP_API_BASE_URL=https://your-backend.example.com/
REACT_APP_API_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8080/

